    <string name="user_notice_title">User Notice</string>
    <string name="user_notice_body">1. FloatAI supports Android 8.0+ (API 26+).\n\n2. The float window requires the Display over other apps permission.\n\n3. The AI feature requires you to configure the provider API URL and key. This app does not store any model or chat data.\n\n4. Packet capture uses the standard Android VpnService API; traffic is processed locally only.\n\n5. Use this app in compliance with local laws and regulations.\n\n6. This app is open-source under the Apache License 2.0. Use at your own risk.</string>

    <string name="permission_notice_title">Permission Agreement</string>
    <string name="permission_notice_body">This app requests the following permissions:\n\n• Display over other apps — for the AI float window.\n• Foreground service (FOREGROUND_SERVICE / DATA_SYNC) — to keep the float window and capture service alive.\n• Post notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS) — for the float window and capture service.\n• Internet (INTERNET) — to call the AI provider API.\n• Access network state (ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE) — to check network availability.\n• Microphone (RECORD_AUDIO) — optional, voice input.\n• Camera (CAMERA) — optional, photo capture and OCR.\n• Package usage stats (PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS) — recent apps in the float window.\n• VPN Service (VpnService) — optional, packet capture.\n\nPlease confirm that you understand the above before continuing.</string>

